  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/38401808/163054137-8bdde290-e939-4f6a-a788-4842866cb1bf.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1344\" height=\"50\"></span><span style=\"font-size:18px\">這個針對 <a style=\"font-size:18px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/loot-integrations\" rel=\"nofollow\">Loot Integrations</a> 的附加元件，強化了以下 <a style=\"font-size:18px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/aureljz/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\">Aureljz</a> 結構中的戰利品：<br></span></p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/when-dungeons-arise\" rel=\"nofollow\">When Dungeons Arise</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/when-dungeons-arise-seven-seas\" rel=\"nofollow\">When Dungeons Arise - Seven Seas</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/underground-bunkers\" rel=\"nofollow\">Underground Bunkers</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/hellish-trials\" rel=\"nofollow\">Nether Trials &amp; Chambers</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/yeehaw-towns\" rel=\"nofollow\">Yeehaw Towns!</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/aether-villages\" rel=\"nofollow\">Aether Villages</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/towers-of-the-wild-additions\" rel=\"nofollow\">Towers of the Wild: Additions</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/when-dungeons-arise-lost-architects\" rel=\"nofollow\">When Dungeons Arise - Lost Architects</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/simply-houses\" rel=\"nofollow\">Simply Houses</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/twilight-treehouses\" rel=\"nofollow\">Twilight Treehouses</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/abandoned-camps\" rel=\"nofollow\">Abandoned Camps</a></span></li>\n</ul><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">戰利品將更具多樣性，並從可比較的原版戰利品表中選取，這些表也包含模組化戰利品，以確保與所有新增戰利品的模組相容。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">僅需在伺服器端安裝，無需安裝所有相關模組。</span><br><img style=\"font-size:18px\" src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/38401808/163059508-bfcdb9fc-5f49-4204-afff-d9ae9460beda.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1344\" height=\"50\"></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">無已知不相容問題，應可與其他任何模組共同運作。</span></p><p><img src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/38401808/162635503-85e3e64b-3263-4498-944e-ba9741a3c88d.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1344\" height=\"50\"></p><p>若您喜歡此模組，請考慮支持開發工作，任何支持都將不勝感激。</p><p>開發工作為無償的業餘活動，因此任何支持都有助於投入更多時間於此。<br>您可以在 Patreon 上支持我，或僅是幫忙宣傳。</p><p><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/someaddons\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/38401808/162637017-9a30d47b-493d-4743-9029-ac09dcc438f9.png\" width=\"300\" height=\"29\"></a></p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
